<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harrah's upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harrah's upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday it raised its rating on the shares of Harrah's Entertainment Inc to a strong buy from neutral.  </p>
<p>-- Rating upgraded reflected opinion that Harrah's had already endured the worst in terms of overcapacity in its gaming markets.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-7/8 to 19-7/9.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
